The United States of America is a federal republic consisting of [[U.S. planetary commonwealth|eight planetary commonwealths]], which are divided into several hundred states and territories, along with a federal district (Washington, D.C., the capital city of the United States). Several [[Associated state|sovereign states are also in free association with the US.]]

